          "date": "2026-11-06 00:34:27.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-12032 tests: skip conf-sanity 123F for older MGS",
        "message": "LU-12032 tests: skip conf-sanity 123F for older MGS\n\n\"lctl set_param -F\" was accidentally disabled in 2.16 and only\nrestored by LU-16134, so conf-sanity 123F always fails when the\nMGS runs a release without that fix, as in b2_16 server interop\ntesting. Skip the test on such an MGS, as 123G already does for\napply_yaml.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=123F\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-sonnet-5-5\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I44aa16d38baa797c890fd196faf13c316e92cb71\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
